PoC 1 (14 November 2026): CMY V1 vs CMY 2.0 Orientation-Agnostic Multi-Crease + Medial Axis Decomposition
Tested directly on Projects/14_ArmGuard_13-November-2026/components/Arm_Flare/cmy/C_005/ (read-only).
